### =====================================================================
### API de Cotización de Envíos
### Levanta la app con `make run` y ejecuta estas peticiones con un clic
### (IntelliJ IDEA, o VS Code con la extensión REST Client).
### =====================================================================

### Catálogo de zonas soportadas -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/zones

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### CASO FELIZ
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Cotización estándar (3.5 kg) -> 200 OK
### 140.00 base + 3.50 x 18.00 = 203.00, 2 días hábiles, overweight: false
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "METROPOLITAN",
  "destination": "NATIONAL_CENTRAL",
  "weightKg": 3.50
}

### Peso exactamente en el límite estándar (50 kg) -> 200 OK, overweight: false
### Es el último peso SIN recargo. Ver la sección de inconsistencias del README.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "METROPOLITAN",
  "destination": "NATIONAL_EXTENDED",
  "weightKg": 50.00
}

### Sobrepeso (55 kg) -> 200 OK, overweight: true
### Tarifa estándar + 40% de recargo + 1 día hábil extra.
### Total 2191.00 = (190.00 + 55 x 25.00) x 1.40
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "METROPOLITAN",
  "destination": "NATIONAL_EXTENDED",
  "weightKg": 55.00
}

### Último peso transportable (70 kg) -> 200 OK, overweight: true
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "NATIONAL_CENTRAL",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL_NA",
  "weightKg": 70.00
}

### Los códigos de zona se normalizan (minúsculas y espacios) -> 200 OK
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "  metropolitan ",
  "destination": "national_central",
  "weightKg": 1.00
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### ERRORES DE FORMATO -> 400
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Falta un campo obligatorio -> 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "METROPOLITAN",
  "destination": "NATIONAL_CENTRAL"
}

### Tres campos inválidos a la vez -> 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
### `details` trae los tres, no solo el primero.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "",
  "destination": "   ",
  "weightKg": 0
}

### Peso negativo -> 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
### Es un problema de rango, no una regla de negocio.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "METROPOLITAN",
  "destination": "NATIONAL_CENTRAL",
  "weightKg": -2.00
}

### Más de 2 decimales en el peso -> 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "METROPOLITAN",
  "destination": "NATIONAL_CENTRAL",
  "weightKg": 3.5555
}

### JSON roto -> 400 MALFORMED_REQUEST
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "origin":

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### REGLAS DE NEGOCIO -> 422
### Sintácticamente impecables, semánticamente inválidas.
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Destino fuera del catálogo -> 422 UNSUPPORTED_ZONE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "METROPOLITAN",
  "destination": "MARS",
  "weightKg": 3.50
}

### Origen fuera del catálogo -> 422 UNSUPPORTED_ZONE (field: "origin")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "MARS",
  "destination": "NATIONAL_CENTRAL",
  "weightKg": 3.50
}

### Peso por encima del máximo transportable -> 422 WEIGHT_LIMIT_EXCEEDED
### Ojo: 422 y no 400. El envío es válido, el servicio no lo puede mover.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "METROPOLITAN",
  "destination": "NATIONAL_EXTENDED",
  "weightKg": 71.00
}

### Origen igual a destino -> 422 ORIGIN_EQUALS_DESTINATION
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "NATIONAL_CENTRAL",
  "destination": "national_central",
  "weightKg": 3.50
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### OTROS CÓDIGOS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### URL inexistente -> 404 RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND (mismo contrato de error)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/zonas

### Método equivocado sobre una URL válida -> 405 METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes

### Content-Type equivocado -> 415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: text/plain

origin=METROPOLITAN
